{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1471468-psions-and-mega-attributes","id":1471468,"title":"Psions and mega-attributes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-29T17:33:53-08:00","id":1471468,"title":"Psions and mega-attributes","content":"I was thinking about this. Granted, because the books are supposed to be independent, in that you don't need aberrant to play Trinity or Trinity to play aberrant, it's not included, but could some psions mimic at least low levels of mega attributes, say 1-3? Biokenetics and vitakenetics can modify and/or boost their bodies, while Quantakenetics can tap into quantum energies, and the other psions have their own methods to justify it. What do you think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-29T18:18:08-08:00","id":1471470,"title":"","content":"Not exactly, but low levels can be mimicked partially to a certain extend and partial results.<br /> <br /> Mega Might would be achievable with Telekinesis<br /> Mega Dexterity would be a combination of BK/VK and Clair to predict what should be done and how the results can be optimized.<br /> Mega Stamina probably with Perikinesis combined with BK/VK to boost against indirect damage.<br /> Mega Socials are basically a combination of different uses of Telepathy<br /> Mega Mentals would need Clairsentience and Telepathy with different combinations to different aspects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-29T23:15:05-08:00","id":1471478,"title":"","content":"I'd just assumed that the level 6 powers that boost the Scale of an effect would cover it, although that would only increase the scale by 1. I.e, Telekinesis 4 lets you increase Might to a maximum of 7 dots at scale one, but with the level 6 power increasing scale that would be a maximum of 7 dots at scale 2.<br /> <br /> The level 7 powers might need to be handwaved. Electrokinesis 7 would seem to give effects that would definitely be a higher scale than a normal human intellect, for example- how it would interact with a mega-intelligent Nova's encryption would likely have to be a GM call.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26448,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26448-shalmaneser","user":"Shalmaneser","date":". 12-30-2021, 02:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26448-shalmaneser","name":"Shalmaneser","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-29T23:16:08-08:00","id":1471479,"title":"","content":"There is also, not yet, the chance for Scale for Psions so you can mimic things but not fully.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-30T04:02:04-08:00","id":1471486,"title":"","content":"The 6th dot of each Mode gives Scale, so that combined with Attribute boosters gives Attributes of +1 Scale. This doesn\u2019t mimic all the effects of the equivalent Mega-Attribute but covers some.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}